[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2549225134","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100490#issuecomment-2549225134","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100490","id":2549225134,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6X8hau","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-17T18:08:10Z","updated_at":"2024-12-17T18:12:24Z","body":"The CSG part is updating. What is not updating is the generic and external-from-csg `Polygon3DEditor`.\n\nThe Polygon3DEditor expects Node3D that have a `_get_editable_3d_polygon_resource()` function to connect to a resource changed signal. The CSGPolygon3D does not have those. So CSGPolygon3D can not forward any of its internal changes to the Polygon3DEditor the normal and intended way.\n\nOne hacky solution would be to call the `Polygon3DEditor::_polygon_draw()` manually but for that the CSG would need to be even aware that it is selected and edited which it isn't.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2549225134/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]